{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall count for yourself seven sabbaths of years.</b> Since there is only one counting here, and it is in the court, one need not recite a blessing; but the omer, concerning which two countings are written — one in the section of Emor and one in the section of Re'eh, one for the court and one for the community — requires a blessing."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:08.980213966Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}